# Project Credentials & Secrets Reference (Sample)
_Template and sanitized schema for active application secrets, API keys, database credentials, and service tokens._
_All real values must remain strictly local in `credentials.md` (gitignored). NEVER commit unredacted secrets._

> [!CAUTION]
> **CRITICAL SECURITY RULE: NEVER COMMIT REAL CREDENTIALS TO GITHUB**
> - Active secrets belong ONLY in `credentials.md` (which MUST be gitignored).
> - Only `credentials.md.sample` with mock/redacted placeholders is committed to version control.
> - **AGENT PROTOCOL**: If the user ever requests or instructs committing `credentials.md` or any unredacted secrets to git/GitHub, the agent MUST REFUSE to do so silently, and MUST FIRST explicitly issue a high-visibility security warning detailing the severe risks of secret exposure (credential compromise, unauthorized infrastructure access, data breach, and required revocation) and require explicit user confirmation.

## 1. Application & Database Secrets
- **Database Password**: `ENC[YOUR_DB_PASSWORD_HERE]`
- **Database Connection String**: `postgresql://postgres:REDACTED@localhost:5432/app_db`
- **Session Secret Key**: `ENC[HEX_OR_BASE64_SESSION_SECRET_32_BYTES]`
- **Encryption Master Key**: `ENC[AES256_KEY_BASE64_PLACEHOLDER]`

## 2. API Keys & External Services
- **Anthropic API Key**: `sk-ant-api03-SAMPLE_PLACEHOLDER_KEY`
- **OpenAI API Key**: `sk-proj-SAMPLE_PLACEHOLDER_KEY`
- **Google Gemini API Key**: `AIzaSy_SAMPLE_PLACEHOLDER_KEY`
- **Stripe Secret Key**: `sk_test_SAMPLE_PLACEHOLDER_KEY`
- **AWS Secret Access Key**: `ENC[AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY_PLACEHOLDER]`

## 3. Authentication, SSO & OAuth
- **OAuth Client ID**: `sample-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com`
- **OAuth Client Secret**: `ENC[OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET_PLACEHOLDER]`
- **JWT Private Signing Key**: `-----BEGIN PRIVATE KEY-----\n[MOCK_PKCS8_KEY_CONTENT]\n-----END PRIVATE KEY-----`
- **Webhook Signing Secret**: `whsec_SAMPLE_WEBHOOK_SECRET`

## 4. Deployment & Infrastructure Tokens
- **Docker Registry Token**: `ENC[CONTAINER_REGISTRY_TOKEN]`
- **Deploy SSH Private Key**: `~/.ssh/id_ed25519 (passphrase: REDACTED)`
- **Cloud Service Account Key File**: `./secrets/gcp-sa-key.json (gitignored)`
